{{- /* The directory, relative to a standard clone's root, that worktrunk nests the clone's worktrees
       under: .claude/worktrees where the claudeWorktrees data flag is true, else .worktrees.

       This is the ONE mapping from the flag to the directory. Every template that needs the
       directory renders this partial and none holds its own copy: base.toml.tmpl (worktrunk's
       standard-clone default), worktree-dir.tmpl (the one-line file wt-config-gen and fleet-repo
       read) and the worktrunk regeneration trigger. The flag is read with `get`, so a chezmoi config
       generated before the flag existed reads as false. The output has no trailing newline. */ -}}
{{- if get . "claudeWorktrees" -}}
.claude/worktrees
{{- else -}}
.worktrees
{{- end -}}
